  (:adr/body
  "# ADR-2607181200: Closing — fuchi itonami offline SS priority-stack + merge inventory

**Status**: accepted (code-complete-unlanded for G–J)  
**Date**: 2026-07-18  
**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki  
**Repo**: `etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-fuchi`  
**Depends on**: ADR-2607177000 (public-person + Tier-0), ADR-2606052300 (fuchi R0), ADR-2607173000 (nbb-only script host)

## Context

Continuous gap-fill for **robotics/itonami job-loss × etzhayyim covenantal SS offline** pipeline in fuchi, with fixed priorities:

1. **L0 enroll offline**
2. **disclosure hold + continuity SM + held-stress**
3. **rails R1→gated DESIGN** — care/housing first (孫/子), then food/energy (mitsuho/hikari), then vocation/residual

Invariants (unchanged): wellbecoming > 孫 > 子; public-person **facts only**; no scores; cash≡0; live default refuse; no live deploy.

Owner also required **nbb not bash** for land/test entrypoints (ADR-2607173000).

This ADR is the **closing inventory**: what landed on GitHub `main`, what remains local WIP, and west pin lag.

## Decision (closing facts)

### Priority stack SSoT (design, when landed)

```
(1) L0 enroll offline scaffold
(2) disclosure hold + continuity + held-stress
(3) mitsuho (care-first path) R1 → gated-live DESIGN
    care → housing → mitsuho → hikari → tooling → compute → liquidity
```

Machine-readable design (local): `data/priority-stack-design.edn` + `methods/priority_stack.cljc` (`run-offline`, `public-facts`, `assert-public-facts!`).  
Readiness SSoT: `data/itonami-offline-ss-readiness.edn` status **`:code-complete-unlanded`**.

### SHA snapshot (verified 2026-07-18 via GitHub API)

| Ref | SHA | Note |
|---|---|---|
| Local checkout HEAD | `d6400f34…` | last local commit: housing gated-receive/produce |
| GitHub `main` tip | `bb449edd…` | **ahead of local by 2**: standalone migration |
| West pin (`manifest/west.yml`) | `d647f062…` | **behind** both housing and main tip |
| Housing tranche (merged into main ancestry) | `d6400f34…` | merge-base with main tip |

Compare `d6400f34...bb449edd`: status **ahead**, ahead_by **2**, behind_by **0** — pure forward from housing; main re-homed sources under `src/fuchi/methods/` + `test/fuchi/methods/`.

### Merge inventory (answer: それぞれは merge ずみ?)

| Tranche | Merged to GitHub `main`? | West pin? | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| A. ADR-2607177000 public-person / Tier-0 | **yes** | pin lag | policy accepted |
| B. L0 enroll + disclosure SM | **yes** | pin lag | under `src/fuchi/methods/` on tip |
| C. held-stress L0→L6→G7 | **yes** | pin lag | |
| D. all-seven rails R1→gated DESIGN through housing | **yes** | pin lag | through `d6400f34` |
| E. scorecard / public / audit / pages plan-only | **yes** | pin lag | |
| F. standalone layout (`methods/`→`src/fuchi/…`) | **yes** | pin lag | tip `bb449edd`; **local checkout not pulled** |
| G. `priority_stack` SSoT + offline.edn surfaces | **no** | no | 404 on main; local WIP |
| H. nbb land/test/publish entrypoints | **no** | no | main still has `bb.edn` / `bb test` docs |
| I. portable nbb suite + dual-key facts | **no** | no | must re-home onto `src/` layout |
| J. west pin advance | **no** | **no** | still `d647f062` |
| K. live produce / grant / loan / wrangler | **n/a refuse** | n/a | never in this closing |

**Short answer:** offline SS **through housing full-chain refuse is on GitHub main**. The **priority_stack SSoT + nbb land path is not merged**. Superproject **west pin has not caught up** even to the already-merged housing tip.

## Consequences

1. **Closing this loop as documentation**: this ADR + readiness file are the SSoT for “what is done vs unlanded.”
2. **Next land path** (when terminal works; agent shell was ENOENT this session):
   - `git fetch` fuchi; reconcile local WIP onto `origin/main` (`bb449edd`, `src/fuchi/` layout) without force-push
   - port G–I files into `src/fuchi/methods/` + nbb entrypoints at repo root
   - `nbb methods/readiness_check.cljs` → `priority_stack_smoke` → `run_tests` → `write_all`
   - commit/push ff-only to `main`
   - west/fleet pin advance `com-etzhayyim-fuchi` to new tip (single-entry; verify remote)
3. **Do not** treat local `methods/` tree as main tip after standalone migration.
4. Live disbursement remains out of scope.

## Alternatives rejected

1. **Declare fully merged** — false; G–J open.
2. **Force-push local d6400f34 over bb449edd** — forbidden; would drop standalone migration.
3. **Advance west pin without landing G–I** — optional for A–F only; prefer pin to true tip after G–I land.

## Not in scope

- live mitsuho/hikari produce
- live land-grant / loan / wrangler Pages deploy
- personal scores / ranks
- cash disbursement
")))
